  "body": "Tucked away in the peaceful Garden Terrace cul-de-sac, just moments from the waterfront and a short walk to the downtown ferry, this substantial residence offers an exceptional setting for family living, with generous proportions and an enviable location. Set within a private quarter-acre section with established subtropical gardens, the property also features a fully self-contained minor dwelling, offering flexibility for extended family, guests or additional income. A truly special opportunity to secure space, privacy and an easy lifestyle for your family, in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal communities.\r\n\r\nThe main residence features four spacious bedrooms, including a superb primary suite with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. Three additional bedrooms share a family bathroom with a luxurious bathtub. \r\nA second lounge with a fireplace offers a cosy retreat, while the open-plan living and dining area features pitched ceilings and an oversized skylight that floods the space with natural light. Large doors open to the patio, creating effortless indoor-outdoor living, while a relaxed seating area provides the perfect place for family catch ups.\r\nAt the heart of the home is a well appointed kitchen with a walk in pantry that will delight keen cooks. \r\nStep outside and discover a delightful garden made for entertaining and play. The large lawn area offers ample room for a swimming pool, trampoline, outdoor games and memorable summer gatherings.\r\nEverything that makes Devonport such a special place to live is close at hand. Walk to local schools, cafes, restaurants and bars, with the library, cinema, supermarket and ferry all within walking distance.\r\nThis is more than a generous home; it is a place for family gatherings, celebrations and effortless entertaining. A home where memories can be made for generations, offering the space and flexibility to welcome your family through every stage of life.\r\nDon't let this one pass you by.  Get the family settled for 2027 and enjoy everything this home has to offer.\r\n\r\nTender 1st December at 12.00pm (Unless Sold Prior)\r\nTo download property files, please go to: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/EW57",
